@MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5261
@email = teste@example.com
@password = Sup3rSecret!

### Registrar
POST {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Renovar tokens (use o refreshToken retornado pelo login)
POST {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Perfil do usuário logado
GET {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Atualizar perfil
PUT {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo-email@example.com"
}

### Criar pasta
# @name createFolder
POST {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Documentos",
  "parentFolderId": null
}

### Listar conteúdo da raiz
GET {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar conteúdo de uma pasta
GET {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/folders/{{createFolder.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Renomear pasta
PUT {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/folders/{{createFolder.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Documentos Pessoais"
}

### Excluir pasta
DELETE {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/folders/{{createFolder.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Upload de arquivo
# @name uploadFile
POST {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="exemplo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Conteúdo de exemplo.
--boundary--

### Download do arquivo enviado acima
GET {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/files/{{uploadFile.response.body.id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Excluir a própria conta
DELETE {{MyPrivateDrive.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
